0bf7b49c2ef208ded007376104" :answer-field/choices ["q-85060/selection/3d5e44a73cf7780d6741d97f546f63478e48d16b22c56feedcd1fd99ff2ecde9" "q-85060/selection/009636f495b5ae6c35d85e9c052dc8f11883450bf7b49c2ef208ded007376104" "q-85060/selection/e4b6357bba98c55f8749b6fc05c451858a649f2da930b71613910f780568b484" "q-85060/selection/7517b0e5a0691d7f2a6ca5cd028ec09c7b970037798301c91432fe1c35142b0f" "q-85060/selection/e14bf59c5688704b313b83b190cd1478a71e69847ef43794697542ba812653e9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-85060" :question/id #uuid "2b47b34a-1974-5599-b1be-0d4b61ed5472" :question/math-academy-id "q-85060" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14056707/assets/0d91ac9127718b0f2755ec14c268d23af810c2ec6f13b4935930b4b348b76b34.png)\n\nThe region $D$ in the plane is enclosed between two circles centered at $O$ of radii $1$ and $3,$ as shown above. What is\n${∬}_{D}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A$\nexpressed in polar coordinates?" :question/worked-solution "We will use the change of variables formula in the form \n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{ }dA={∬}_{Δ}\\text{ }f(r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\,r\\text{ }drd\\theta .\n$$\n\nThe region $D$ represents a portion of the washer enclosed between the circles of radii $1$ and $3$ centered at the origin. In polar coordinates $(r,\\theta ),$ the region can be expressed as \n\n$$\nΔ={(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,1\\le r\\le 3,\\,0\\le \\theta \\le 2\\pi }.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\,\\text{ }dA & ={∬}_{Δ}({r}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{r}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,r\\,\\text{d}r\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{\\int }_{1}^{3}{r}^{2}({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,r\\,\\text{d}r\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{\\int }_{1}^{3}{r}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-85060/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1f13c3a8-ba48-5299-b335-3752e8b92ef4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-85060"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-85061/selection/dc988f9273c795900353ab3e5b50b013eb47935a810f19348981be4b65757645" :answer/id #uuid "b83119d4-d638-5c55-8d46-eac9f9a8762c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{\\pi }^{3\\pi /2}{\\int }_{9}^{25}3r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85061/selection/b152b224ea10db196738f9b5a02c616035122076fc89fe5690185948ebbed1dc" :answer/id #uuid "00de5bad-7cdc-5abd-aa19-1d454d2e081a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{\\pi }^{3\\pi /2}{\\int }_{3}^{5}3{r}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85061/selection/396b52ee4bc957e0c24a02e7d970b98c27f59a741d186652315a64be964de787" :answer/id #uuid "6fb1c558-ce13-5f56-bdc1-35bc2cf7730f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{3}^{5}{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{-\\pi /2}3{r}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85061/selection/99a5fbeefb3979eedb9a72b16571cf912c98a848d62bd86b8a632151b4f71382" :answer/id #uuid "556f7ea8-650b-5724-b395-545682970260" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{9}^{25}3r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85061/selection/8e08f8a063b5f5ecb5316b12e552e3eeaf5a5e1fa327fe12afabbd8b1ba370bd" :answer/id #uuid "390208c7-2e35-56bf-87c9-14bbc62811bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{0}{\\int }_{3}^{5}3{r}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85061/s